## CyrenaBuilderExtensions (Components.Core)

**Namespace**: `Cyrena.Extensions`
**Assembly**: `Cyrena.Components.Core`

### Purpose
Extension methods on `CyrenaBuilder` for registering UI components in the Cyréna application. Provides methods to add settings page components and keyboard shortcuts.

### Class Definition

```csharp
public static class CyrenaBuilderExtensions
{
    [Obsolete("Use new section mapping API")]
    public static CyrenaBuilder AddSettingsComponent<TComponent>(this CyrenaBuilder builder)
        where TComponent : ComponentBase;

    public static CyrenaBuilder AddSettingsComponent<TComponent>(this CyrenaBuilder builder, string section)
        where TComponent : ComponentBase;

    public static CyrenaBuilder AddSettingsComponent<TComponent>(this CyrenaBuilder builder, string section, int order)
        where TComponent : ComponentBase;

    public static CyrenaBuilder AddShortcut<TShortcut>(this CyrenaBuilder builder)
        where TShortcut : class, IShortcut;
}
```

### Methods

#### `AddSettingsComponent<TComponent>()` [Obsolete]
```csharp
[Obsolete("Use new section mapping API")]
public static CyrenaBuilder AddSettingsComponent<TComponent>(this CyrenaBuilder builder)
    where TComponent : ComponentBase;
```
Registers a Blazor component as a settings tab with no section and **order 10** (delegated to `ComponentOptionsExtensions.AddSettingsComponent<T>()`). **Obsolete** — use the section overloads instead.

**Implementation:** Resolves `ComponentOptions` via `builder.GetFeatureOption<ComponentOptions>()` and calls `ui.AddSettingsComponent<TComponent>()`.

#### `AddSettingsComponent<TComponent>(string section)`
```csharp
public static CyrenaBuilder AddSettingsComponent<TComponent>(this CyrenaBuilder builder, string section)
    where TComponent : ComponentBase;
```
Registers a Blazor component under the specified settings section with **order 10** (delegated default to `ComponentOptionsExtensions`).

#### `AddSettingsComponent<TComponent>(string section, int order)`
```csharp
public static CyrenaBuilder AddSettingsComponent<TComponent>(this CyrenaBuilder builder, string section, int order)
    where TComponent : ComponentBase;
```
Registers a Blazor component under the specified settings section with the given display order.

#### `AddShortcut<TShortcut>()`
```csharp
public static CyrenaBuilder AddShortcut<TShortcut>(this CyrenaBuilder builder)
    where TShortcut : class, IShortcut;
```
Registers a shortcut action in the UI. The shortcut is registered as a scoped service:
```csharp
builder.Services.AddScoped<IShortcut, TShortcut>();
```

### Usage Examples

**Settings Component:**
```csharp
builder.AddSettingsComponent<MySettingsComponent>("General", 1);
```

**Shortcut:**
```csharp
builder.AddShortcut<MyShortcut>();
```

### Related
- `ComponentOptions` - Underlying options class for settings components
- `ComponentOptionsExtensions.AddSettingsComponent()` - Direct option manipulation
- `IShortcut` - Shortcut contract
- `CyrenaBuilder` - Application builder
